            "message": "fix(admin): payouts manual joins, escrow read-only view, inline bank account form\n\n- Rewrote /api/admin/payouts GET to use manual batch queries instead of\n  PostgREST nested joins -- payment_requests has no FK constraints so\n  the aliased join syntax returned nothing; now fetches agreements,\n  profiles, bank accounts, and emails in parallel then merges them\n\n- Repurposed admin escrow page as a read-only financial overview:\n  removed the release-payment button, added status badges (Payment held /\n  Awaiting approval / Awaiting payout), summary strip with total held and\n  per-status counts, and expanded the API query to include paid_held and\n  delivered agreements alongside completed ones; renamed nav tab to Funds\n\n- Replaced the Go to Profile link in the consultant payment request modal\n  with an inline bank account form -- consultants with no saved accounts\n  can now add one without leaving the dashboard; on save the account is\n  inserted, local state updated, and the selector shown immediately so\n  the payment request can proceed in one flow",
